## Demo data

The image runs in development mode, so the local seeders are available. Seed
the admin and the demo workspace, then read the generated admin password:

```sh
docker compose exec app /app/app db:seed FinanceAdminSeeder FinanceDemoSeeder
docker compose exec app sh -c "cat storage/finance-admin-*.txt"
```

Sign in at `/login` with `admin@example.test`. Choose November 2026 to see the
demo transactions. Seeding twice changes nothing.

This is a demo, not a deployment: do not expose it to a network or reuse its
credentials anywhere.
{{- end}}

## Develop with the source instead

```sh
vukem new {{.Name}}-src --example {{.Example}}
```

`.env` holds `APP_KEY`; keep it out of version control. `docker compose down -v`
stops the stack and deletes its data.
